<title>USA: Fort Bend to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Fort Bend to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ROSENBERG, Texas 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Bend Holding Corp said it planned to buy back up to five percent of its outstanding shares, or about 40,960 shares.</p>
<p>The company said the purchases would be made on the open market starting on or after Sept 25.</p>
<p>Fort Bend is the holding company for Fort Bend Federal Savings and Loan Association of Rosenberg.</p>
<p>The company's stock was trading at 18-1/4, up one point, in mid-afternoon on Friday.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
